2. File → New → Maven Project.
3. Create a simple project निवडून Next कर.
4. खालील Values भर.
Field	Value
Group Id	com.stqa
Artifact Id	WebElementInteraction
Version	0.0.1-SNAPSHOT
Packaging	jar

5. Finish कर.

